  ('38bb52d6-76ad-5bd2-ad32-c89e75039782', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221', 'short', 'The study suggests that most first-generation students ______. [A] are from single-parent families来自单亲家庭 [B] study at private universities在私立大学就读 [C] are in need of financial support需要经济资助 / 有资金扶持需求 [D] have failed their college没能完成大学学业 12', null, '[C] are in need of financial support（需要经济支持）', '原文依据（对应标注句③）："Most of the first-generation students (59.1%) were recipients of
